Description: A lightweight pipeline to prepare emergency department visit data,
    build incident-diagnosis count files, write parameter files, and run the
    'TreeScan' command-line software on ICD-10-CM trees. Ported from the
    epiENGAGE TreeScan implementation scripts.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/EpiForeSITE/TreeScan, https://epiforesite.github.io/TreeScan/
